  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Climate Change Alliance Plus (GCCA+) - Scaling Up Agriculture Adaptation to Climate Change in Uganda.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Delegated Agreement with FAO of the UN. The Action shall be carried out in 12 districts in the central cattle corridor; 6 old districts and 6 new adjacent vulnerable districts. The project team will be based at the FAO main office in Kampala with field offices in some of the target districts.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
